{ ---- audio : decoupe d'un WAV selon -ss/-t/-to (filtre atrim de ffmpeg : exact
 a l'echantillon) ---- }
Function O1RdLE32(Var B: Array Of Byte; At: LongInt): Int64;
Begin
 O1RdLE32:=Int64(B[At])+Int64(B[At+1])*256+Int64(B[At+2])*65536+Int64(B[At+3])*
  16777216;
End;

{ lit l'en-tete d'un WAV : renvoie False si ce n'est pas un WAV PCM lisible }
Function O1WavInfo(Const Nm: String; Var Fmt: Array Of Byte; Var FmtLen:
 LongInt; Var DataOff,DataLen: Int64; Var Rate,Align: LongInt): Boolean;
Var F: File; Sz,Cur,CL: Int64; H: Array[0..63] Of Byte; N: LongInt; Got,HaveFmt:
 Boolean;
Begin
 O1WavInfo:=False; Got:=False; HaveFmt:=False;
 Assign(F,Nm); {$I-}Reset(F,1);{$I+}
 If IOResult<>0 Then Exit;
 Sz:=FileSize(F);
 If Sz<12 Then Begin Close(F); Exit; End;
 BlockRead(F,H,12,N);
 If (N<12) Or (H[0]<>82) Or (H[1]<>73) Or (H[2]<>70) Or (H[3]<>70) Or (H[8]<>87)
  Or (H[9]<>65) Or (H[10]<>86) Or (H[11]<>69) Then Begin Close(F); Exit; End;
 Cur:=12;
 While Cur+8<=Sz Do Begin
  Seek(F,Cur); BlockRead(F,H,8,N);
  If N<8 Then Break;
  CL:=O1RdLE32(H,4);
  If (H[0]=102) And (H[1]=109) And (H[2]=116) And (H[3]=32) Then Begin
   If (CL<16) Or (CL>SizeOf(Fmt)) Then Break;
   Seek(F,Cur+8); BlockRead(F,Fmt,CL,N);
   If N<CL Then Break;
   FmtLen:=CL; Rate:=O1RdLE32(Fmt,4); Align:=Fmt[12]+Fmt[13]*256; HaveFmt:=True;
  End Else If (H[0]=100) And (H[1]=97) And (H[2]=116) And (H[3]=97) Then Begin
   DataOff:=Cur+8; DataLen:=CL;
   If (CL<0) Or (DataOff+CL>Sz) Or (CL=4294967295) Then DataLen:=Sz-DataOff;
   Got:=True; Break;
  End;
  Cur:=Cur+8+CL+(CL And 1);
 End;
 Close(F);
 O1WavInfo:=Got And HaveFmt And (Align>0) And (Rate>0);
End;

{ decoupe : ecrit Dst ; renvoie le nombre d'echantillons ecrits (-1 si Src n'est
 pas un WAV) }
Function O1AudioJob(Const Src,Dst: String): Int64;
Var Fmt: Array[0..63] Of Byte; FmtLen,Rate,Align: LongInt; DataOff,DataLen,
 Total,A,B,Cnt,Lim: Int64; Fi,Fo: File;
 Hd: Array[0..43] Of Byte; Buf: PEABuffer; Pos,Q,Done: Int64; N: LongInt; I:
  LongInt; Rec: Int64; HasRec: Boolean; Code: Integer; Tot32: Int64;
 Procedure Put32(At: LongInt; V: Int64); Var K: LongInt; Begin For K:=0 To 3 Do
  Begin Hd[At+K]:=V And 255; V:=V Shr 8; End; End;
Begin
 O1AudioJob:=-1;
 If Not O1WavInfo(Src,Fmt,FmtLen,DataOff,DataLen,Rate,Align) Then Exit;
 Total:=DataLen Div Align;
 A:=0; B:=Total;
 If O1HasInSS Then A:=A+O1Resc(O1InSS,Rate,1000000);
 If A>Total Then A:=Total;
 { duree d'entree }
 HasRec:=False; Rec:=0;
 If O1HasInT Then Begin HasRec:=True; Rec:=O1InT; End
 Else If O1HasInTo Then Begin HasRec:=True; If O1HasInSS Then Rec:=O1InTo-O1InSS
  Else Rec:=O1InTo; End;
 If HasRec Then Begin Lim:=O1Resc(Rec,Rate,1000000); If Lim<>0 Then If A+Lim<B
  Then B:=A+Lim; End;
 { sortie : debut puis duree }
 If O1HasOutSS Then Begin A:=A+O1Resc(O1OutSS,Rate,1000000); If A>B Then A:=B;
  End;
 HasRec:=False; Rec:=0;
 If O1HasOutT Then Begin HasRec:=True; Rec:=O1OutT; End
 Else If O1HasOutTo Then Begin HasRec:=True; If O1HasOutSS Then Rec:=O1OutTo-
  O1OutSS Else Rec:=O1OutTo; End;
 If HasRec Then Begin
  Lim:=O1Resc(Rec,Rate,1000000);
  If Rec=0 Then B:=A
  Else If Lim<>0 Then If A+Lim<B Then B:=A+Lim;
 End;
 If B<A Then B:=A;
 Cnt:=B-A;
 Assign(Fi,Src); {$I-}Reset(Fi,1);{$I+}
 If IOResult<>0 Then Exit;
 Assign(Fo,Dst); {$I-}Rewrite(Fo,1);{$I+} Code:=IOResult;
 If Code<>0 Then Begin O1Msg(16,'Cannot create '+Dst); O1Die(1); End;
 FillChar(Hd,SizeOf(Hd),0);
 Hd[0]:=82; Hd[1]:=73; Hd[2]:=70; Hd[3]:=70; Hd[8]:=87; Hd[9]:=65; Hd[10]:=86;
  Hd[11]:=69;
 BlockWrite(Fo,Hd,12);
 Hd[0]:=102; Hd[1]:=109; Hd[2]:=116; Hd[3]:=32; Put32(4,FmtLen);
 BlockWrite(Fo,Hd,8); BlockWrite(Fo,Fmt,FmtLen); If Odd(FmtLen) Then Begin Hd[
  0]:=0; BlockWrite(Fo,Hd,1); End;
 Hd[0]:=100; Hd[1]:=97; Hd[2]:=116; Hd[3]:=97; Put32(4,Cnt*Align);
 BlockWrite(Fo,Hd,8);
 GetMem(Buf,32768+64);
 Pos:=DataOff+A*Align; Done:=0;
 While Done<Cnt*Align Do Begin
  Q:=Cnt*Align-Done; If Q>32768 Then Q:=32768;
  Seek(Fi,Pos); BlockRead(Fi,Buf^,Q,N);
  If N<=0 Then Break;
  BlockWrite(Fo,Buf^,N); Inc(Pos,N); Inc(Done,N);
 End;
 If Odd(Cnt*Align) Then Begin Hd[0]:=0; BlockWrite(Fo,Hd,1); End;
 Tot32:=FileSize(Fo)-8;
 Seek(Fo,4); Put32(0,Tot32); BlockWrite(Fo,Hd,4);
 Close(Fo); Close(Fi);
 FreeMem(Buf);
 O1AudioJob:=Cnt;
End;


Var O1InG,O1OutG: Integer;       { groupes entree / sortie }
 O1Sz: Boolean; O1SzW,O1SzH: LongInt;
