   F='dts') Or (F='oma') Or (F='s16le') Or (F='s16be') Or (F='s8') Or (F='u8')
   Or (F='mulaw') Or (F='alaw') Or
  (F='s24le') Or (F='s24be') Or (F='s32le') Or (F='s32be') Or (F='f32le') Or (
   F='f32be') Or (F='u16le') Or (F='u16be') Or (F='ogg') Or (F='oga') Or (
   F='opus') Or (F='mka') Or (F='m4a') Or (F='sox') Or (F='ircam') Or (F='wma');
